    "gates": "ALL GATES CLEARED. G0' PASS (no row before 2028). G1' NOT GATED (D64 §2.4 publishes no NEISO band); reported er/phys 0.8074–1.4964 over 29 rows. G2' PASS on all 29 rows — fixed_cost_scale == capex_scale, and capex/k host-invariant within every year. G3' PASS (discharged at zero LP). G4' PASS — the invariant set {I3 FAIL, I13 WARN} is IDENTICAL to the prior neiso-2026-2050-t3-golden3-d60's, zero PASS → FAIL flips. G5' (the in-kind form, the only form Addendum C states for this leg) PASS — the converted set gains NO from_fuel class and NO unit class the incumbent did not have; all 29 rows are gas_cc → gas_cc_ccs. G6' PASS — 30.1 min against the ~33 min estimate (2× bound 66 min) and 3.56 GB against the 14 GB bound.",
